# NOTE: config.js IS committed on purpose.
# It contains only the PUBLIC Supabase anon/publishable key, which is designed
# to ship to the browser and is protected by Row Level Security. Committing it
# lets the app deploy to Vercel/Netlify without a build step and avoids the
# "/config.js 404" error. Never put the service_role key here.

